#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Cloud-init bootstrap for a Nebula control-plane node (role: ${role}).
set -euo pipefail

dnf update -y
dnf install -y tar gzip iproute

# --- Nebula (data plane) ---
cd /tmp
curl -fsSL -o nebula.tar.gz \
  "https://github.com/slackhq/nebula/releases/download/v${nebula_version}/nebula-linux-amd64.tar.gz"
%{ if nebula_sha256 != "" ~}
echo "${nebula_sha256}  nebula.tar.gz" | sha256sum -c -
%{ else ~}
echo "WARNING: nebula_sha256 not set — skipping checksum verification (supply-chain gap)." >&2
%{ endif ~}
tar -xzf nebula.tar.gz -C /usr/local/bin nebula nebula-cert
install -d -m 0700 /etc/nebula

# --- Control-plane layout ---
id -u ncp >/dev/null 2>&1 || useradd -r -s /usr/sbin/nologin ncp
install -d -o ncp -g ncp -m 0750 /opt/nebula-control-plane /var/lib/ncp

cat >/root/NEXT-STEPS.txt <<'EOF'
Role: ${role}
Nebula data plane is installed at /usr/local/bin/nebula (+ nebula-cert).
This box has an IAM instance role + IMDSv2-only, so it is ready for M5 AWS
sigv4 attestation: sts:GetCallerIdentity works with no extra permissions.

The harbor / pilot / gateway binaries are NOT auto-installed (no public signed-
release pipeline yet — impl-plan 1.2). The genesis bootstrap script
(deploy/scripts/bootstrap-genesis.sh) builds them locally and scp's them up for
you; or build+copy by hand:
  GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o /tmp/harbor  ./cmd/harbor
  GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o /tmp/pilot   ./cmd/pilot
  GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o /tmp/gateway ./cmd/gateway
  scp /tmp/{harbor,pilot,gateway} ec2-user@<this-ip>:/tmp/ && \
    sudo install -m0755 /tmp/{harbor,pilot,gateway} /usr/local/bin/

Role-specific next steps:
  lighthouse -> pilot init -am-lighthouse; receive ca.crt + lighthouse cert from
                genesis; run nebula. (handled by bootstrap-genesis.sh)
  harbor     -> harbor migrate up; harbor genesis ...; run gateway + enroll
                worker (+ core-api on the overlay). (handled by the script)
  client     -> pilot enroll -gateway <harbor gw> -join-key <secret>
                -config-pub <pin>; then pilot supervise.
See docs/Nebula Control Plane - Genesis Runbook.md.
EOF
